{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950290/extras/0bd7b062a20f07a7b785ca30467fff25.avif?t=1773499700\" width=1428 height=586 /></span><strong>Escape the nightmare\u2026 if you can.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You play as\u00a0Veronica\u2014a woman who wakes up in the dark, decaying basement of a mysterious mansion. Disoriented and alone,\u00a0you quickly realize the horrors that await you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PS1-Style Survival Horror</strong> \u2013 Classic low-poly visuals and chilling atmosphere inspired by the golden age of horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive by Choice</strong> \u2013 Conserve ammo, face monsters head-on with your guns, or flee into the Dark with only your flashlight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950290/extras/8f308de1b3243b56f8d4084d96950393.poster.avif?t=1773499700\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950290/extras/8f308de1b3243b56f8d4084d96950393.webm?t=1773499700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950290/extras/8f308de1b3243b56f8d4084d96950393.mp4?t=1773499700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deadly Challenges</strong> \u2013 Dodge deadly traps, solve cryptic puzzles, and endure relentless enemies that stalk every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Progression Through Survival</strong> \u2013 Find weapons, manage scarce resources, and uncover notes, clues, and memories that piece together Veronica\u2019s past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950290/extras/ce818702bb195d699a4d3e523154ed6c.poster.avif?t=1773499700\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950290/extras/ce818702bb195d699a4d3e523154ed6c.webm?t=1773499700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950290/extras/ce818702bb195d699a4d3e523154ed6c.mp4?t=1773499700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the Truth</strong> \u2013 The deeper you go, the more you\u2019ll learn about the mansion\u2019s fall, the cursed artifact, and the fate of Veronica.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950290/extras/2bbb749b3788387171c8ec0f5e78d00f.poster.avif?t=1773499700\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950290/extras/2bbb749b3788387171c8ec0f5e78d00f.webm?t=1773499700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950290/extras/2bbb749b3788387171c8ec0f5e78d00f.mp4?t=1773499700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3950290?t=1773499700","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3950290?t=1773499700","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950290/4d5efcb7d5bcd19c9e137ed60950325ebbf145b5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773499700","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950290/4d5efc